message: "If you use this software, please cite it using the metadata from this file."
type: software
title: "powerbi-pbir-mcp: Agentic Power BI PBIR, PBIP & DAX Model Context Protocol (MCP) Server for Report Editing, Semantic Models and Row-Level Security"
abstract: "Local, standard-library-only Python MCP server that lets AI agents load, scaffold, edit and validate Power BI Project (PBIP) reports saved in the PBIR format: pages, visuals, themes and layout via batched apply plans, plus semantic model tables, DAX measures, relationships, hierarchies, perspectives and row-level security (RLS) roles."
